        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="measurement-note-text" parent="1" vertex="1" value="FAULT: workload firewall drops UDP and TCP DNS (:53) to 168.63.129.16. Azure DNS itself is not shut down.&lt;br&gt;OBSERVED: first successful West lookup = Windows 1.088 s; Ubuntu 10.082 s. West answered 15/15 calls per OS.&lt;br&gt;The OS selects the secondary; the application has no retry loop. Only DNS is blocked, not all Azure platform traffic.&lt;br&gt;After restoration: Windows&amp;#x27;s three immediate probes used East; Ubuntu&amp;#x27;s three stayed on West. Failback is not instant." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#242424;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="1065" width="1780" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="measurement-scope" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Timing scope: native DNS lookup duration, not fault-to-recovery time or application availability. 15 native lookups per OS per main test variant." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#605E5C;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="1173" width="1780" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
