        <mxCell id="measurement-note-text" parent="1" vertex="1" value="FAULT A: drop East-outbound-subnet DNS at upstream firewall. First West lookup: Windows 1.105 s; Ubuntu 5.079 s.&lt;br&gt;FAULT B (separate run): reachable East upstream returns SERVFAIL. Windows 1.109 s; Ubuntu 5.075 s.&lt;br&gt;Each variant: 15/15 West answers per OS; zero native lookup failures. Primary Azure DNS remains reachable.&lt;br&gt;IMPORTANT: West requests preceded Azure&amp;#x27;s SERVFAIL response. These Azure-path tests prove timeout-driven fallback." style="fontFamily=Segoe UI;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=16;fontColor=#242424;fontStyle=0;">
          <mxGeometry x="48" y="1065" width="1780" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
